<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A combo for Liu Kang, you need to stand to the left of your opponent, it's not long and is more effective if you have one bar of augmented attack.
A - Left
S - Down
D - Right
W - Up
Y - 1 - Light hand strike
U - 2 - Heavy Hand strike
H - 3 - Light kick
J - 4 - Heavy Kick
F - Action - Interaction with the map/Strengthening special abilities
To activate the combination while on the right side, use the above keyboard shortcut.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
